    "Delete (on an empty field: close the keyboard)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1文字削除（空のときはキーボードを閉じる）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detects earlier than the thresholds and limits flashes of 20% or more of the screen to 2 per second (recommended).": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "基準より早めに検出し、画面の 20% 以上の明滅を 1 秒に 2 回までに抑えます（推奨）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detects scenes where the whole screen flashes hard (explosions, lightning, …) and holds only the display toward the darker side to reduce the number of flashes (based on the WCAG 2.x general flash and red flash thresholds). Small flashes and normal scrolling are shown as they are. Recorded input, game progress and reproducibility are not affected. It can also be applied to MP4 exports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面全体が激しく点滅する場面（爆発・稲妻など）を検出し、表示だけを暗い側に抑えて明滅の回数を減らします（WCAG 2.x の一般閃光・赤色閃光の基準を目安にしています）。小さな点滅や通常のスクロールはそのまま表示します。記録される入力・ゲームの進行・再現性には影響しません。MP4 書き出しにも適用できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard Damaged Checkpoints and Open": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壊れたチェックポイントを破棄して開く"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard Damaged Sections and Open": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
