    },
    "You can open it by discarding only the damaged practice sections (their A/B points are lost). Your takes (recordings) are not changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壊れた練習区間だけを破棄して開けます（その区間のA/Bは失われます）。テイク（録画）は変更されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can’t save to the temporary location.": {
